<title>INDIA: India CARE assigns AAA rating for IDBI bond issue.</title>
<headline>India CARE assigns AAA rating for IDBI bond issue.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Credit Analysis &amp; Research Ltd (CARE) on Wednesday said it assigned a CARE AAA rating to the 100-billion-rupee &quot;Omni bonds&quot; issue of the Industrial Development Bank of India (IDBI).</p>
<p>IDBI is India's largest long-term lending bank.</p>
<p>CARE AAA denotes high investment grade, the firm said in a statement. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
